      ],
      "content": "SP 8707               WENDOVER               TRING ROAD north side 11/295                                       Nos. 21A & 23 (Nos 6, Boleyn Cottage, and No.7 Coldharbour). (formerly, listed asNos 6 & 7 21/12/67                                     Coldharbour Terrace) GV                                           II Pair of cottages, part of row. C17 altered. Timber framed with colourwashed brick infill. Thatched roof, central brick chimney. Set back slightly from RH bay of No.21 (q.v.). 2-storeys, upper windows cut up into thatch. 3 bays. Boleyn Cottage LH bay with one 3-light leaded upper casement, door to LH and 5-light leaded casement to RH of ground floor. No.7 Coldharbour 2 RH bays, door with two 2-light leaded casements to LH, one to RH, 2 upper windows with 2-light leaded casements above wallplate. 3-light wood casements below. RCHM I.p.310. MONS.41-45"
    }
  ],
